WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:03.920
WRITTEN BY HYUUGA NATSU

01:31.591 --> 01:32.842
&lrm;THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
&lrm;FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS

01:32.926 --> 01:34.302
&lrm;MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
&lrm;TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS

01:38.598 --> 01:41.309
SWEETS

01:41.392 --> 01:42.811
How much is this?

02:23.059 --> 02:26.020
What is all this, Granny?

02:26.104 --> 02:27.814
It seems to be an order from Maomao.

02:27.897 --> 02:28.857
Again?

02:30.483 --> 02:32.735
Looks like it'll bring in good money.

02:32.819 --> 02:34.821
Deliver it as instructed.

02:34.904 --> 02:35.864
Understood.

02:45.540 --> 02:47.292
It’s beautiful.

02:47.375 --> 02:49.627
I was thinking of displaying it
in my room.

02:50.962 --> 02:52.130
Are you doing well today?

02:52.213 --> 02:53.756
Ah, yes.

03:23.369 --> 03:27.624
After the garden party, the Lord Shishou
requested additional maids.

03:27.707 --> 03:29.959
But with this many maids…

03:30.043 --> 03:31.169
Yes.

03:31.252 --> 03:34.255
This will make it difficult for the other
ladies to keep their dignity.

03:35.089 --> 03:36.758
Good day to you.

03:36.841 --> 03:38.176
Consort Loulan.

03:47.310 --> 03:50.521
-Oh? Are you looking for something?
-Ah, no.

03:50.605 --> 03:52.232
If it's Maomao, she's in the clinic.

04:02.116 --> 04:03.451
Spring has come.

04:15.588 --> 04:17.340
What are you doing?

04:17.423 --> 04:19.467
What do you mean by "what"?

04:19.550 --> 04:22.053
I'm making perfume oil.

04:22.136 --> 04:26.057
I was cleaning the medical office
and found the distillation equipment.

04:26.140 --> 04:29.978
These are the leftover roses I prepared
when making blue roses the other day.

04:30.061 --> 04:31.854
That’s quite a strong smell.

04:31.938 --> 04:36.317
Compared to wild roses, it's weaker.
Is there something you need?

04:38.278 --> 04:41.364
With a scent this strong,
anyone would be curious.

04:42.657 --> 04:46.327
Doing this here is a bit difficult
compared to the Jade Pavilion.

04:46.411 --> 04:47.662
That’s true, but…

04:48.496 --> 04:51.916
some perfume oils have an effect
that terminates pregnancy.

04:52.000 --> 04:55.295
Although I don't think it will be
a problem unless it’s really strong.

04:55.378 --> 04:59.966
Then, should the perfumes used
in the rear palace be regulated?

05:00.049 --> 05:01.634
No, it shouldn't be a problem.

05:02.260 --> 05:05.096
<i>The quack doctor is a good person,</i>
<i>but talks too much.</i>

05:05.179 --> 05:08.641
<i>I shouldn’t let anyone know</i>
<i>about Lady Gyokuyou's pregnancy yet.</i>

05:08.725 --> 05:10.184
What about this?

05:11.019 --> 05:13.146
I’m distilling alcohol.

05:13.229 --> 05:16.607
If you distill it multiple times,
it becomes stronger.

05:18.860 --> 05:20.069
Are you going to drink it?

05:20.153 --> 05:21.779
It’s for disinfecting.

05:21.863 --> 05:23.740
At the Jade Pavilion
where the small princess is,

05:23.823 --> 05:26.617
I want to keep it as clean as possible.

05:26.701 --> 05:28.286
Can you really do that?

05:28.369 --> 05:30.204
You can soak cloth in it

05:30.288 --> 05:34.125
and use it for cleaning,
among other things.

05:34.208 --> 05:36.044
You sure know a lot.

05:36.127 --> 05:38.171
In the West, they use it that way, right?

05:39.297 --> 05:41.382
I believe your foster father…

05:41.466 --> 05:43.634
I’ve brought your luggage.

05:50.183 --> 05:51.517
What is this?

05:51.601 --> 05:54.145
This is something for the young lady…

05:55.271 --> 05:59.067
Lord Jinshi, I’ll prepare tea,
so please sit down.

05:59.150 --> 06:00.234
What’s inside?

06:01.069 --> 06:04.197
This is just a small package
from my family, nothing special.

06:04.947 --> 06:06.824
From your family?

06:06.908 --> 06:08.326
<i>Jeez, what a guy!</i>

06:08.409 --> 06:12.330
It’s just some undergarments.

06:14.207 --> 06:15.458
Ah, I see.

06:16.209 --> 06:19.921
But for two men to bring it,

06:20.004 --> 06:21.923
what material is this
undergarment made of?

06:22.006 --> 06:23.883
-Damn.
-Huh?

06:26.219 --> 06:28.304
The problem at the rear palace is,

06:28.387 --> 06:31.599
being a virgin is demanded.

06:31.682 --> 06:35.853
Most of the women servants gathered
in the rear palace are virgins.

06:35.937 --> 06:38.356
Even if they’re favored by the Emperor,

06:38.439 --> 06:41.609
if they make a mistake
due to ignorance, it’s pitiful.

06:42.276 --> 06:44.946
They need to study in advance.

06:45.029 --> 06:48.116
So, you prepared this for them?

06:48.199 --> 06:51.786
<i>If you're wondering what book it is,</i>
<i>it's that one.</i>

06:53.371 --> 06:58.042
<i>I had it delivered to the medical office</i>
<i>so Hongniang wouldn’t find out.</i>

06:58.793 --> 07:01.546
<i>I ordered it for the Emperor</i>
<i>since he loves to read.</i>

07:01.629 --> 07:05.550
<i>And I ordered a bit more,</i>
<i>hoping to expand the market,</i>

07:05.633 --> 07:07.301
<i>but perhaps it was bad timing.</i>

07:09.637 --> 07:11.556
-Huh?
-This is…

07:12.223 --> 07:14.600
It’s been made quite beautifully.

07:14.684 --> 07:16.477
It’s made with good paper.

07:16.561 --> 07:20.648
<i>Oh, I thought</i>
<i>he was going to criticize it.</i>

07:20.731 --> 07:23.651
Books like this are sometimes
used as dowries.

07:23.734 --> 07:26.195
Even those who can't read
can enjoy the illustrations,

07:26.279 --> 07:27.613
so there's a demand for these.

07:27.697 --> 07:28.739
Is it a woodblock print?

07:28.823 --> 07:32.535
No, it’s printed using metal plates,
not woodblocks.

07:32.618 --> 07:33.911
That’s impressive.

07:33.995 --> 07:35.955
Yes! Since it’s such a fine product,

07:36.038 --> 07:38.583
I think it should be seen by more people.

07:38.666 --> 07:41.711
However, this is a different matter.

07:45.548 --> 07:48.759
If you like it, you should keep a copy.

07:49.552 --> 07:51.971
No, that’s not it.
I’m definitely not thinking that!

07:54.432 --> 07:56.851
Well, this time I suppose,
I’ll let it slide.

07:56.934 --> 07:58.352
Is that okay?

07:58.436 --> 08:01.230
Tell me the name of the store
where this is sold.

08:03.065 --> 08:06.736
I told you, that’s not it!
I just want to know how they print it.

08:08.613 --> 08:10.781
Yes, I understand.

08:10.865 --> 08:12.492
The name of the store, right?

08:15.411 --> 08:16.454
Xiaomao!

08:16.537 --> 08:18.206
What is it?

08:18.289 --> 08:21.542
I think risqué items might
need censorship.

08:22.210 --> 08:25.546
But the Emperor said
the previous ones didn't have enough.

08:25.630 --> 08:27.173
Not allowed.

08:30.218 --> 08:34.639
<i>The shrewd lady worked</i>
<i>so hard to select them.</i>

08:44.524 --> 08:46.943
Beneath the beautiful flowers in bloom,

08:47.026 --> 08:49.278
what am I searching for?

08:53.241 --> 08:56.327
Hey, what do you think is buried here?

08:58.621 --> 08:59.789
Horse manure?

09:00.831 --> 09:02.208
See, it's because you're too greedy.

09:02.291 --> 09:03.751
It's all your fault, Maomao!

09:03.834 --> 09:06.295
This novel is super popular right now!

09:06.379 --> 09:08.714
Can you read, Xiaolan?

09:08.798 --> 09:10.049
I can't read.

09:10.132 --> 09:13.219
But the ones who can read
read it aloud for everyone else.

09:13.302 --> 09:16.347
I can't wait to find out
what happens next!

09:16.430 --> 09:20.560
<i>If even illiterate maids are</i>
<i>talking about it,</i>

09:20.643 --> 09:22.645
<i>it must be incredibly popular.</i>

09:27.817 --> 09:29.026
I'm back.

09:29.777 --> 09:30.820
What’s that?

09:30.903 --> 09:34.282
His Majesty distributed it
to all his consorts.

09:34.365 --> 09:37.785
He said once we're done reading it,
to please share it with others.

09:37.868 --> 09:39.579
Maomao, want to give it a read?

09:40.788 --> 09:43.833
<i>Looks like it's the same one</i>
<i>Xiaolan mentioned…</i>

09:43.916 --> 09:45.876
<i>A popular novel, huh?</i>

09:45.960 --> 09:49.714
<i>It's not considered very refined</i>
<i>among the upper class, and yet…</i>

09:49.797 --> 09:51.424
<i>Why would he…?</i>

09:52.258 --> 09:56.679
<i>This mark… it’s the one</i>
<i>I showed Lord Jinshi the other day.</i>

09:56.762 --> 10:01.225
<i>Even for a novel, the quality is fit</i>
<i>for a gift from the Emperor.</i>

10:01.309 --> 10:03.853
<i>And if all the consorts received a copy,</i>

10:03.936 --> 10:06.063
<i>there must have been at least 100 printed.</i>

10:06.147 --> 10:08.941
<i>Lord Jinshi probably requested it</i>
<i>from the Emperor.</i>

10:09.609 --> 10:12.320
<i>I should've taken a commission for that.</i>

10:13.029 --> 10:14.739
<i>But why?</i>

10:14.822 --> 10:20.077
<i>Why distribute something considered</i>
<i>indecent to well brought up consorts…?</i>

10:23.748 --> 10:27.460
<i>I know it must have something</i>
<i>to do with politics,</i>

10:27.543 --> 10:29.420
<i>but he's definitely up to something.</i>

10:29.503 --> 10:31.464
Ah, it’s already over.

10:31.547 --> 10:34.008
I want to read the next part soon.

10:34.091 --> 10:35.259
Lord Gaoshun said

10:35.343 --> 10:38.804
when a new one is made,
he’ll distribute it again.

10:38.888 --> 10:40.181
What’s wrong?

10:41.515 --> 10:45.144
Aren’t we the only maids
serving the Jade Pavilion?

10:45.227 --> 10:47.396
It feels wasteful for only us

10:47.480 --> 10:51.317
to enjoy something gifted by Her Highness.

10:51.400 --> 10:53.944
But we can’t give it to
anyone outside the palace.

10:54.028 --> 10:55.655
We need to handle it carefully.

10:55.738 --> 10:57.448
If it gets lost, it’ll be a problem.

10:58.199 --> 11:00.159
You’re right.

11:01.494 --> 11:04.246
Instead of giving out the booklet itself,

11:04.330 --> 11:07.166
why not copy it by hand?

11:07.833 --> 11:10.294
The illustrations might be difficult,

11:10.378 --> 11:12.421
but Ailan, you have lovely handwriting.

11:12.505 --> 11:15.424
It shouldn’t be a problem.

11:15.508 --> 11:17.343
Do you think so?

11:18.177 --> 11:20.054
Would you really bother doing that?

11:20.137 --> 11:22.807
Yinghua, don’t say such things.

11:22.890 --> 11:27.186
<i>If it aligns with Lord Jinshi's intent,</i>
<i>this is probably the right answer.</i>

11:27.895 --> 11:29.939
<i>If books spread</i>
<i>throughout the inner palace,</i>

11:30.022 --> 11:32.942
<i>more people will try to learn how to read.</i>

11:33.025 --> 11:36.320
<i>If it’s a popular novel, even better.</i>

11:37.405 --> 11:40.241
<i>When I was a maid serving Lord Jinshi,</i>

11:40.324 --> 11:42.034
<i>I was asked this question.</i>

11:42.660 --> 11:46.539
Apothecary, how can we improve
the literacy rate of the women in service?

11:47.665 --> 11:51.293
<i>Even so, it’s quite a roundabout way</i>
<i>of going about it.</i>

11:54.213 --> 11:55.548
Hey, Maomao!

11:55.631 --> 11:57.800
I want you to teach me
how to read and write!

11:57.883 --> 11:58.926
What's up with that?

11:59.635 --> 12:02.888
The girl who always reads the novel
for me has read it too many times,

12:02.972 --> 12:04.807
and now she lost her voice.

12:04.890 --> 12:07.768
She made a copy of the book for me,

12:07.852 --> 12:09.520
but I can’t read.

12:09.603 --> 12:12.148
-Then let me read it for you.
-No, that’s not allowed!

12:14.150 --> 12:17.111
She spent so much time writing it,

12:17.194 --> 12:18.904
I can’t cheat like that.

12:21.991 --> 12:24.827
<i>-You’re amazing…</i>
-What’s this all of a sudden? What?

12:25.870 --> 12:26.829
This is your name.

12:27.872 --> 12:29.290
Try writing it by copying me.

12:29.373 --> 12:30.332
Got it.

12:30.416 --> 12:32.835
XIAOLAN

12:33.627 --> 12:37.047
My name is actually
quite difficult, isn’t it?

12:37.131 --> 12:39.133
The more you write, the more you can read,

12:39.216 --> 12:41.010
but do you want to just learn how to read?

12:42.136 --> 12:44.096
Since I’m here,
I want to learn to write too.

12:44.180 --> 12:48.100
Once I leave the palace,
I’ll have to find my own job,

12:48.184 --> 12:50.102
so being able to write
will be useful, right?

12:53.272 --> 12:54.899
-What? What?
<i>-In your own little way.</i>

12:54.982 --> 12:57.151
<i>You seem to be thinking about your future.</i>

12:57.860 --> 13:00.112
Well then, let’s try to study more.

13:00.196 --> 13:02.364
Okay. Thanks.

13:02.448 --> 13:03.908
What is this called?

13:03.991 --> 13:06.160
-Winter worm, summer grass.
-How about this?

13:06.243 --> 13:07.536
Mandala flower.

13:08.662 --> 13:10.998
-What’s this?
-Kudzu root.

13:11.749 --> 13:13.209
Oh…

13:13.292 --> 13:17.171
Are these words used on a daily basis?

13:17.254 --> 13:18.672
First, let's start with greetings.

13:18.756 --> 13:19.924
And then?

13:48.369 --> 13:51.038
Has Princess Lingli been granted
permission to go for a walk?

13:51.121 --> 13:54.833
Yes, since staying only within the palace
is getting a bit cramped,

13:54.917 --> 13:57.169
I decided to ask about it.

13:57.253 --> 14:01.131
She’s running around everywhere now.
What do you think, Maomao?

14:01.882 --> 14:02.967
Given her health,

14:03.050 --> 14:07.596
I think it’s better to increase
her opportunities to go outside.

14:08.389 --> 14:11.433
There will be two eunuchs as guards,

14:11.517 --> 14:14.436
but could you accompany her
along with Hongniang?

14:14.520 --> 14:15.938
Understood.

14:16.021 --> 14:20.192
<i>Until now, all of the emperor’s children</i>
<i>have died young.</i>

14:20.276 --> 14:25.030
<i>It might seem overly protective</i>
<i>for just a walk, but it can't be helped.</i>

14:25.114 --> 14:27.908
Maomao, you know so much
about flowers and creatures,

14:27.992 --> 14:30.411
so could you teach those things
to Lingli during your walk?

14:31.453 --> 14:33.706
Lady Gyokuyou, that’s not a good idea.

14:33.789 --> 14:35.749
She’ll only teach her useless things.

14:37.001 --> 14:39.003
I think it’ll be useful.

14:39.837 --> 14:42.631
We don’t know where she might
marry in the future, right?

14:42.715 --> 14:46.051
<i>Although she’s still young,</i>
<i>in about ten years,</i>

14:46.135 --> 14:48.012
<i>she might be married off somewhere.</i>

14:49.054 --> 14:51.015
<i>If she goes to another country,</i>

14:51.098 --> 14:53.517
<i>there’s no guarantee she’ll be welcomed.</i>

14:55.603 --> 14:59.857
<i>Knowledge of medicine and poison</i>
<i>will never be harmful.</i>

14:59.940 --> 15:01.525
<i>She truly is a wily consort.</i>

15:08.824 --> 15:11.368
<i>Reactions to the princess vary.</i>

15:12.703 --> 15:16.248
<i>Everyone has their own view</i>
<i>of the princess.</i>

15:17.124 --> 15:20.753
<i>Eventually, the princess herself will</i>
<i>understand the meaning behind those gazes.</i>

15:24.048 --> 15:25.883
That is primrose.

15:32.306 --> 15:34.141
Oh, Princess!

15:36.518 --> 15:37.770
Ah, Princess!

15:40.064 --> 15:41.690
Princess! That’s not allowed.

15:41.774 --> 15:42.650
I will go look.

15:48.739 --> 15:49.823
A kitten?

15:49.907 --> 15:52.201
Almost…

15:55.537 --> 15:58.082
Kitty! Meow, meow.

15:58.165 --> 15:59.416
Princess!

16:02.002 --> 16:03.128
Meow!

16:03.212 --> 16:04.880
I'll try to catch it…

16:04.964 --> 16:06.632
<i>I have no choice.</i>

16:14.974 --> 16:16.517
Got you!

16:21.981 --> 16:23.607
Do you want this?

16:29.530 --> 16:33.283
Huh? It looked like you were
trying to catch it.

16:33.367 --> 16:34.743
Was I wrong?

16:35.536 --> 16:38.122
-Ah, thank you.
-Here.

16:38.956 --> 16:41.375
Maybe this little one is hungry.

16:41.458 --> 16:43.168
I'll leave the rest to you.

16:43.252 --> 16:44.294
Alright then.

16:49.133 --> 16:50.759
Maomao, is that…

16:50.843 --> 16:52.720
Yes, it's a cat.

16:54.304 --> 16:55.597
It's dirty,

16:55.681 --> 16:58.434
so it would be best if the princess
doesn't touch it.

16:59.852 --> 17:01.186
You… you're right.

17:05.107 --> 17:07.526
For now, let's take it in.

17:07.609 --> 17:10.070
-I’ll inform the higher-ups.
-Understood.

17:10.154 --> 17:13.240
Oh, that's rare. It's a kitten.

17:13.323 --> 17:14.867
I found it.

17:14.950 --> 17:17.453
Poor little thing, it’s trembling.

17:17.536 --> 17:19.455
I just finished boiling some water.

17:19.538 --> 17:20.998
Wait a moment.

17:22.750 --> 17:24.793
<i>But still, it’s strange.</i>

17:25.627 --> 17:28.672
<i>There are hardly any pets</i>
<i>in the inner palace.</i>

17:29.506 --> 17:31.800
<i>Keeping animals requires permission,</i>

17:31.884 --> 17:34.803
<i>and for cats and dogs,</i>
<i>sterilizing is mandatory.</i>

17:34.887 --> 17:37.598
<i>I wonder where this kitten was born?</i>

17:38.974 --> 17:42.186
Put the hot water in a <i>sake</i> bottle
wrapped in a cloth like this,

17:42.269 --> 17:43.937
and place it near the cat like this.

17:44.021 --> 17:45.898
You seem to know a lot.

17:45.981 --> 17:48.150
I once found one before.

17:48.233 --> 17:50.152
It was a lovely calico cat.

17:50.235 --> 17:51.445
Oh?

17:54.156 --> 17:56.450
It’s quite thin, isn’t it?

17:56.533 --> 17:58.410
Do you have milk from livestock?

17:58.494 --> 18:00.829
Should I get some from the dining hall?

18:00.913 --> 18:02.456
Also, livestock intestines.

18:02.539 --> 18:04.500
In… intestines?!

18:04.583 --> 18:07.336
I thought it would take the place
for the parent cat's nipple.

18:07.419 --> 18:10.672
Since sausage was served a few times,
maybe the kitchen has some.

18:10.756 --> 18:12.925
Got it, I’ll ask.

18:15.761 --> 18:19.139
<i>Now, ideally, I’d like to bathe it,</i>

18:19.223 --> 18:21.683
<i>but in its current state,</i>
<i>it doesn’t have the strength.</i>

18:22.851 --> 18:26.438
<i>So instead, I’ll wipe its dirty body</i>
<i>with a hand towel</i>

18:27.147 --> 18:30.067
<i>and use oil to kill the fleas.</i>

18:31.485 --> 18:34.154
Hey, young lady, we’ve got goat’s milk!

18:34.238 --> 18:35.989
I also managed to get intestines.

18:36.073 --> 18:37.699
Thank you very much.

18:44.540 --> 18:47.459
So cute! So adorable!

18:49.336 --> 18:52.297
<i>That night, the Emperor</i>
<i>visited the Jade Pavilion.</i>

18:53.882 --> 18:56.009
I’ve decided to keep the kitten.

18:57.302 --> 19:00.139
I’ll leave its care to you.

19:00.222 --> 19:02.933
<i>The Emperor is quite the doting parent.</i>

19:03.016 --> 19:05.352
For Maomao, taking care of a kitten

19:05.435 --> 19:07.396
fits her perfectly, given her name.

19:10.983 --> 19:13.735
<i>Once the kitten regained some strength,</i>

19:13.819 --> 19:16.488
<i>I washed its body</i>
<i>with soap bean detergent.</i>

19:16.572 --> 19:18.699
Oh, the water’s turned grey.

19:19.408 --> 19:23.036
<i>After feeding it milk for a while,</i>
<i>it got healthier.</i>

19:23.120 --> 19:25.706
<i>It started eating shredded chicken.</i>

19:25.789 --> 19:28.083
<i>When we placed a wooden box</i>
<i>filled with sand,</i>

19:28.167 --> 19:30.460
<i>it began relieving itself on its own.</i>

19:34.882 --> 19:37.426
It’d be terrible
if it scratched the princess.

19:37.509 --> 19:39.761
How’s the parenting going?

19:41.346 --> 19:44.308
I think it should be fine
to show it to the princess soon.

19:44.391 --> 19:45.559
I see.

19:46.185 --> 19:47.978
Are those small fish?

19:48.061 --> 19:50.731
They’re a bit hard as-is,
so should I boil them?

19:50.814 --> 19:52.608
Yes, you're right.

19:53.192 --> 19:54.234
Is it female?

19:54.318 --> 19:57.112
Yes. I’m relieved
we don’t need to neuter it--

19:58.071 --> 19:59.364
I apologize.

19:59.448 --> 20:02.075
No, no need to be so formal.

20:02.159 --> 20:03.952
As an apology, perhaps some tea sweets…

20:05.746 --> 20:08.248
<i>It wouldn’t be appropriate to serve these.</i>

20:11.919 --> 20:13.170
Would you like to try?

20:13.253 --> 20:15.505
I don’t particularly like cats.

20:15.589 --> 20:16.840
With that name?

20:16.924 --> 20:18.258
I get that a lot.

20:18.342 --> 20:21.178
You, on the other hand,
seem like a cat lover, Lord Jinshi.

20:23.138 --> 20:25.182
Not as much as those two.

20:25.933 --> 20:28.227
I can’t quite understand
what’s so appealing about them.

20:28.310 --> 20:30.187
Same here.

20:30.270 --> 20:31.980
But according to cat lovers,

20:32.064 --> 20:35.442
it’s the mystery of not knowing what
they’re thinking that makes them charming.

20:36.235 --> 20:39.446
Just watching them becomes so captivating
that you can’t look away.

20:39.529 --> 20:42.115
Eventually, you feel like touching them.

20:43.325 --> 20:45.202
Even though they’re usually indifferent,

20:45.285 --> 20:49.665
It's frustrating that they only
warm up to you when food is given.

20:51.625 --> 20:55.587
When it gets to that point,
it seems people just give up.

20:56.588 --> 20:59.925
<i>Squishing their paws or kissing them…</i>

21:00.008 --> 21:02.052
<i>it’s unsanitary if you ask me.</i>

21:08.016 --> 21:10.018
What’s the matter, Lord Jinshi?

21:13.772 --> 21:15.649
I think I’m starting to understand.

21:18.694 --> 21:20.279
<i>Is that so?</i>

21:20.946 --> 21:24.866
<i>In the end, where the kitten came from</i>
<i>remained a mystery.</i>

21:24.950 --> 21:29.288
<i>It was concluded that the cat sneaked</i>
<i>into a cart entering the rear palace.</i>

21:30.205 --> 21:31.832
<i>Afterward, the kitten was given</i>

21:33.750 --> 21:36.962
<i>a grand title, "Rat Exterminator,"</i>

21:37.045 --> 21:39.172
<i>by the Emperor himself.</i>

21:39.923 --> 21:41.049
<i>In short,</i>

21:41.133 --> 21:44.928
<i>it was tasked with getting rid of</i>
<i>the rats from the medical storage.</i>

21:45.929 --> 21:46.888
MAOMAO

21:46.972 --> 21:48.223
<i>However…</i>

21:48.890 --> 21:52.352
<i>The fact that its name became "Maomao"</i>

21:52.436 --> 21:53.603
<i>is something I can't accept.</i>

21:57.607 --> 21:59.109
Let’s tidy this up quickly.

21:59.192 --> 22:02.446
That’s right, the caravan
will be arriving soon.

22:03.405 --> 22:04.698
Caravan?

23:46.049 --> 23:49.469
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:56.768 --> 23:59.020
<i>The next episode is "Caravan."</i>

23:59.104 --> 24:00.897
Subtitle translation by:
Abhishek Chand Ramola
